            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method including: performing by processing circuitry of a Radio Access Network, RAN, node, the processing circuitry in communication with a Non-Real-Time RAN Intelligent Controller, Non-RT RIC, of a Service Management and Orchestration, SMO, entity of an Open RAN, O-RAN, and a Near-RT RIC in the O-RAN; configuring the RAN node for multi-access network traffic management in the O-RAN, the configuring comprising: encoding spectrum utilization information associated with spectrum used by one or more user equipments, UEs, in communication with the RAN node, the encoded spectrum utilization information being for transmission to the Non-RT RIC; decoding a spectrum adjustment policy from the Near-RT RIC associated with the RAN node, the spectrum adjustment policy originating at the Non-RT RIC and based on the spectrum utilization information; and reassigning the spectrum used by the one or more UEs based on the spectrum adjustment policy.</p>
            </abstract>
